# Port only (scenarios/port/): the GPU renderer against the reference renderer on screens past the title that hold
# polygon items (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-19-polygon-objects-design.md, acceptance 4), reached through the
# developers' debug menu (example.arterial-debug-menu; docs/modding/games/arterial.md, "The debug menu"). Each
# comparison's result counts the frame's polygons, the textured ones, the ones with two textures and each blend.
#
# 1. システム: DEBUG.BIN's polygon test, which example.arterial-polygon-blends gives the replace and subtractive blends
#    and a second texture (no script of the game draws them), then its rain, snow and leaves. It returns to the title.
# 2. カードバトル（ＰＧ用）: BTLINFO, then the battle field, whose cards DRAWFIELD draws as textured polygons.
# 3. A win by the turn limit (arterial-debug-events.steps says how), RESULT, and back to the title.
# 4. 全体マップ: the whole map after its tutorial and receipts, and with the cursor on the SHOP point, whose highlight
#    ALLMAP draws as a textured additive polygon.
#
# Every comparison fails past 16 pixels over the tolerance: a moving polygon's edge may round to the other side of a
# pixel or two in each renderer (DEBUG's falling feathers do), while a renderer at fault differs in thousands.
# The reference renderer slows each frame, so the menus are reached by plain waits after `reference-diff on`.
# Run on a fresh sandbox:
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game arterial port start --mod oms/examples/mods/example.arterial-debug-menu --mod oms/examples/mods/example.arterial-polygon-blends
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game arterial port run tools/drive/scenarios/port/arterial-debug-reference-diff.steps
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game arterial port stop

rand-seed 7
wait 5
click adv.next                                   # skips the logo
wait-state script=TITLE timeout=90
wait 6
click title.quit                                 # the debug menu
wait-state waiting=menu timeout=20
click 440 478                                    # システム: DEBUG.BIN
wait 6
reference-diff on
wait 2
expect top=DEBUG@0x23d                           # the polygon test waits for a click
reference-diff arterial-debug-polygons max-over=16
click 512 300
wait 6
reference-diff arterial-debug-effects max-over=16
wait-state top=TITLE@0x8f1 timeout=60            # DEBUG ends: the title's menu
wait 4
click title.quit
wait 4
click 440 329                                    # カードバトル（ＰＧ用）
wait 10
reference-diff arterial-debug-btlinfo max-over=16
click 826 242                                    # BTLINFO's battle start
wait 8
reference-diff arterial-debug-field max-over=16
lua maid.vm.g[0x46910a] = 1 maid.vm.g[0x46910c] = 1 return 0
click 68 548                                     # Auto Battle
speed 8
wait 40
speed 1
wait-state script=RESULT click=adv.next every=3 timeout=90
wait 3
reference-diff arterial-debug-result max-over=16
click 880 515                                    # 決定
wait-state script=TITLE timeout=90
wait 8
click title.quit
wait 4
click 440 270                                    # 全体マップ
wait 10
click 580 485                                    # the tutorial's Next
wait 3
click 580 485
wait 3
point map.middle 512 300
wait-state at=ALLMAP@0x17f2 click=map.middle every=2 timeout=60   # the receipts
wait 2
reference-diff arterial-debug-map max-over=16
move 551 140
wait 1.5
move 551 147                                     # the SHOP point
wait 2
lua local point = maid.vm.g[0x43f5f6] assert(point == 27, point) return point
reference-diff arterial-debug-map-hover max-over=16
